@startuml
title CON-SD-D07 Continuity Terminal Restricted Operation Flow
skinparam shadowing false

start
:Continuity Terminal disabled by default;
if (Approved activation includes terminal scope?) then (yes)
  :Validate terminal, cashier, shift, Site/Site Group, allowed workflows;
  :Display restricted continuity mode;
  :Request backend context from Central PMS;
  if (Backend allows workflow?) then (yes)
    :Display degraded context / payment / fiscal / exit status;
  else (no)
    :Block and route to supervisor/manual review;
  endif
else (no)
  :Continuity Terminal remains unavailable;
endif
:Record terminal activity with incident/audit/reconciliation tags;
stop

note right
The terminal displays backend state and submits allowed input.
It does not declare finality, issue fiscal documents, approve discounts, authorize exit, or open gates.
end note
@enduml
